WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 36

01:48.820 --> 01:50.450
Are you really the Saintess?

01:50.820 --> 01:52.490
Doesn't the Saintess wipe her hands?

01:53.500 --> 01:54.670
What a temper!

01:54.690 --> 01:55.880
Tell me.

01:56.090 --> 01:56.820
How on earth

01:56.820 --> 01:58.520
can you help me kill Xiao En?

01:58.540 --> 02:00.200
I really can't help you do that.

02:00.220 --> 02:02.070
The mission and the cavalry are both around.

02:02.090 --> 02:03.840
If I let you kill Xiao En,

02:03.860 --> 02:05.430
I'm sure to lose my job.

02:05.450 --> 02:07.320
You can come to Beiqi instead.

02:07.620 --> 02:09.610
It's too cold. I'm not used to the weather.

02:10.370 --> 02:12.190
I can assassinate him at the worst.

02:12.210 --> 02:13.600
I'll guard him myself.

02:13.620 --> 02:15.350
Plus the cavalry,

02:15.370 --> 02:17.170
feel free to have a try.

02:18.820 --> 02:20.560
I can hold you hostage.

02:21.290 --> 02:22.820
I'm just a little envoy.

02:22.820 --> 02:25.000
Nobody cares about my life.

02:28.210 --> 02:29.600
We can join hands.

02:29.620 --> 02:30.960
Why?

02:30.980 --> 02:32.560
To help you of course.

02:33.140 --> 02:34.610
Help me what?

02:34.650 --> 02:35.680
To help you and the Empress Dowager

02:35.700 --> 02:36.930
take over power from

02:36.930 --> 02:37.880
your little emperor.

02:37.900 --> 02:39.350
Nonsense!

02:39.370 --> 02:41.120
Who told you I'm with the Empress Dowager.

02:42.820 --> 02:45.200
Your teacher Ku He is the Imperial Tutor.

02:45.980 --> 02:47.450
She certainly has to take side.

02:47.620 --> 02:49.040
As to the political fights of Beiqi,

02:49.060 --> 02:50.760
there are mainly three forces.

02:52.930 --> 02:54.530
One is led by the little emperor.

02:54.820 --> 02:56.070
One is led by the Empress Dowager.

02:56.090 --> 02:57.520
And the other is led by Shangshan Hu,

02:57.540 --> 02:59.000
which remains neutral.

02:59.210 --> 03:00.900
Shangshan Hu wants to save Xiao En,

03:00.900 --> 03:02.120
while you want to kill him.

03:02.140 --> 03:03.710
You're certainly not on the same side.

03:03.730 --> 03:05.730
I could also be a follower of His Majesty.

03:06.900 --> 03:07.910
The little emperor made it clear that

03:07.930 --> 03:09.350
he wants Si Lili back.

03:09.370 --> 03:11.190
If you kill Xiao En in Nanqing,

03:11.210 --> 03:12.880
the mission will have to go back.

03:12.900 --> 03:15.000
Then Si Lili won't be sent to Beiqi.

03:15.540 --> 03:17.620
So you can't be a follower of

03:17.620 --> 03:19.200
the little emperor.

03:19.420 --> 03:20.840
In this case,

03:21.450 --> 03:23.530
you can only be with the Empress Dowager.

03:27.140 --> 03:28.760
Even if you guessed right,

03:28.780 --> 03:31.000
how can you help me?

03:32.450 --> 03:35.200
I'm the envoy of Nanqing after all.

03:35.700 --> 03:37.070
The two of us joining hands together

03:37.090 --> 03:38.480
is beyond all expectations.

03:38.820 --> 03:40.840
By doing so, we'll have everything to gain

03:41.140 --> 03:43.810
and nothing to lose.

03:43.900 --> 03:45.710
You actually know you're from Nanqing.

03:45.730 --> 03:48.250
Yet you want to interfere with political affairs of Beiqi.

03:51.370 --> 03:52.810
I just have a feeling that

03:53.090 --> 03:54.610
it'll be extremely difficult

03:54.650 --> 03:56.730
for me to bring Yan Bingyun back.

03:57.730 --> 03:59.890
We're kind of helping each other out.

04:03.370 --> 04:05.280
You've eaten my fruit after all.

04:12.010 --> 04:14.120
Last night the rain was light, the wind was fierce,

04:14.140 --> 04:16.190
and deep sleep did not dispel the effects of wine.

04:16.210 --> 04:17.590
When I ask the maid rolling up the curtains,

04:17.610 --> 04:19.600
she answers, "The crabapple blossoms look the same."

04:19.820 --> 04:21.240
I cry, "Can't you see? Can't you see?

04:21.260 --> 04:23.570
The green leaves are fresh but the red flowers are fading!"
('crabapple' has the same meaning as 'Haitang' in Chinese)

04:25.020 --> 04:26.440
It's for you.

04:27.370 --> 04:30.130
It's kind of celebrating our cooperation.

04:31.610 --> 04:32.330
Poetic Genius Fan.

04:32.330 --> 04:33.690
What do you think?

04:33.820 --> 04:35.240
The crabapple blossoms can't be exposed to the rain.

04:35.260 --> 04:37.240
Caught in wind and rain, the pot will gather water.

04:37.260 --> 04:38.580
The crabapple blossoms will rot

04:38.580 --> 04:40.570
instead of fading.

04:42.090 --> 04:43.760
I'll take that as a "Yes".

04:49.260 --> 04:51.520
Shen Zhong, Commander-in-chief of Embroidered Uniform Guards,

04:51.540 --> 04:53.440
will receive the mission in person.

04:53.460 --> 04:54.720
Watch out yourself!

04:54.740 --> 04:56.350
What's his character?

04:56.370 --> 04:58.010
Does he have any weakness?

04:58.210 --> 04:59.560
Before reaching Shangjing,

04:59.580 --> 05:01.480
I won't give up on killing Xiao En.

05:12.610 --> 05:13.590
Let's go.

05:13.610 --> 05:15.640
Your Excellency, congratulations!

05:17.370 --> 05:18.640
For what?

05:19.330 --> 05:22.040
Do you have a thing for the Saintess?

05:29.460 --> 05:30.560
Your Excellency, don't worry.

05:30.580 --> 05:32.020
We won't tell Princess Lin

05:32.020 --> 05:33.280
about this.

05:33.300 --> 05:34.300
Gao, how come you're also

05:34.300 --> 05:35.470
making fun of me?

05:35.490 --> 05:38.190
Thanks for Wang's detailed explanation,

05:38.210 --> 05:40.640
I've known Your Excellency well.

05:44.820 --> 05:47.250
Your Excellency! Your Excellency! Your Excellency!

05:47.580 --> 05:48.920
Your Excellency!

05:52.740 --> 05:54.200
How are your wounds?

05:54.740 --> 05:56.040
Do you feel better?

05:57.170 --> 05:58.850
You and Duoduo...

05:59.210 --> 06:00.980
Don't listen to Wang Qinian.

06:00.980 --> 06:02.570
That is not an aphrodisiac.

06:02.890 --> 06:04.440
I've explained to her clearly.

06:06.090 --> 06:07.530
Your Excellency,

06:08.050 --> 06:09.470
after arriving in Beiqi,

06:09.490 --> 06:11.160
I won't go back to Nanqing ever again.

06:11.300 --> 06:12.520
If you tell me,

06:12.540 --> 06:14.530
I won't tell your wife.

06:15.210 --> 06:16.490
Now I can't clear my name

06:16.490 --> 06:18.290
even if I jump into the Yellow River.

06:18.860 --> 06:20.680
Which river is that?

06:20.700 --> 06:22.130
I just made it up.

06:22.580 --> 06:24.440
Do you know Haitang Duoduo?

06:24.860 --> 06:26.030
Yes.

06:26.050 --> 06:29.120
We once had tea together in Shangjing Town.

06:29.140 --> 06:30.520
Is that the capital of Beiqi?

06:30.540 --> 06:31.810
Yes.

06:33.260 --> 06:35.600
She doesn't look like a Saintess.

06:37.650 --> 06:40.090
I envy her character all the time.

06:40.490 --> 06:43.570
She's free, easy, pure, and lovely.

06:43.770 --> 06:46.010
You're perfect for each other.

06:52.820 --> 06:54.030
Let me ask you something.

06:54.050 --> 06:55.560
Something private about Duoduo?

06:55.580 --> 06:57.090
No!

07:01.260 --> 07:02.720
I want to ask

07:03.980 --> 07:06.370
why you took the arrow for me.

07:06.770 --> 07:08.160
I...

07:10.260 --> 07:12.200
I didn't intend to.

07:12.330 --> 07:14.690
Seeing the arrow coming from the corner of my eye,

07:14.860 --> 07:16.530
I just went to you.

07:17.740 --> 07:19.720
I had no time to think.

07:24.050 --> 07:25.480
To be honest,

07:26.610 --> 07:28.410
I still regret it now.

07:28.460 --> 07:30.920
Your Excellency, no need to bother.

07:32.170 --> 07:34.410
After sending me back to Beiqi,

07:35.330 --> 07:37.160
we're even.

07:42.820 --> 07:44.440
We'll reach Beiqi soon.

07:47.930 --> 07:49.440
You're poisoned.

07:49.460 --> 07:51.310
According to the Red Sleeve Edict Scheme,

07:51.330 --> 07:52.400
your little emperor of Beiqi is supposed to

07:52.420 --> 07:54.290
be killed by the poison on your body.

07:55.330 --> 07:56.970
Why do you tell me?

07:59.260 --> 08:00.690
This is the antidote.

08:03.890 --> 08:05.310
Only after you're detoxified

08:05.330 --> 08:07.040
can we really be even.

08:13.300 --> 08:14.760
What about you?

08:15.700 --> 08:16.820
Who would know I'm the one

08:16.820 --> 08:17.960
to detoxify you?

08:17.980 --> 08:19.350
The poison could be ineffective

08:19.370 --> 08:20.760
due to a wrong formula.

08:26.980 --> 08:29.920
If I give this away,

08:30.260 --> 08:32.480
you'll be in trouble, right?

08:35.930 --> 08:37.280
Will you?

08:37.970 --> 08:40.960
Who knows what will happen in future?

08:41.170 --> 08:43.160
Then let's wait and see.

09:47.290 --> 09:48.610
Your Excellency, your hair style is good.

09:48.610 --> 09:50.390
Your clothes are so bright and shining.

09:50.410 --> 09:52.570
Well, leave us alone.

09:58.700 --> 10:00.080
Senior.

10:00.490 --> 10:02.210
We've arrived in Beiqi.

10:02.820 --> 10:04.220
It's your last chance

10:04.220 --> 10:06.210
to kill me.

10:06.260 --> 10:08.520
What's your hidden secret?

10:08.700 --> 10:11.890
This is also your last chance to question me.

10:14.730 --> 10:15.730
Why did you ask me

10:15.730 --> 10:17.400
about Danzhou?

10:17.490 --> 10:19.450
What's your relation with Danzhou?

10:27.700 --> 10:29.010
Fine.

10:30.170 --> 10:31.770
Senior Xiao,

10:31.970 --> 10:33.840
let's make a bet.

10:34.820 --> 10:35.490
This won't be my last question

10:35.490 --> 10:37.130
for you.

11:06.140 --> 11:07.370
You're home.

11:10.290 --> 11:11.150
Now that we're in Beiqi,

11:11.170 --> 11:12.890
I won't be able to visit you often.

11:13.580 --> 11:14.960
Take care of yourself.

11:17.170 --> 11:20.890
Your Excellency, thank you for looking after me all the way.

11:35.660 --> 11:36.680
Who is to receive us?

11:36.700 --> 11:39.590
Your Excellency, it's weird.

11:39.610 --> 11:41.320
There are people receiving us,

11:41.340 --> 11:43.210
but no one answers back.

11:47.140 --> 11:49.390
I'll say it one more time.

11:49.410 --> 11:53.600
The Nanqing mission is here to return prisoners of war.

11:54.100 --> 11:55.340
Who's in charge?

11:55.340 --> 11:56.810
Please answer back at once.

12:05.530 --> 12:08.250
If you remain silent, we'll leave right away.

12:31.170 --> 12:33.080
Your Excellency, they're here.

12:33.100 --> 12:34.770
What are you waiting for?

12:36.410 --> 12:38.570
Your Excellency!

12:46.560 --> 12:48.140
=Shen Zhong, Commander-in-chief of Embroidered Uniform Guards=

12:48.140 --> 12:48.800
Are they here?
=Shen Zhong, Commander-in-chief of Embroidered Uniform Guards=

12:48.800 --> 12:49.880
Are they here?

13:07.340 --> 13:10.950
Excuse me, which one is His Excellency Fan Xian,

13:10.970 --> 13:12.840
the Poetic Genius from Nanqing?

13:14.290 --> 13:16.780
This is His Excellency Fan Xian,

13:16.780 --> 13:19.010
Envoy of Nanqing.

13:20.410 --> 13:21.470
Poetic Genius Fan!

13:21.490 --> 13:22.760
I'm Fan Xian.

13:22.780 --> 13:25.030
I've looked up to your great name for a long time!

13:25.050 --> 13:25.900
On seeing you today,

13:25.900 --> 13:27.730
you're really outstanding as expected.

13:27.730 --> 13:29.270
You are?

13:29.290 --> 13:30.390
I'm Shen Zhong.

13:30.410 --> 13:32.400
Just call me by my name.

13:32.900 --> 13:35.120
Your Excellency Shen,
Commander-in-chief of Embroidered Uniform Guards.

13:35.140 --> 13:36.030
You two should deal with

13:36.050 --> 13:37.440
the handover procedures.

13:37.460 --> 13:38.760
Yes, Your Excellency.

13:38.780 --> 13:41.150
Your Excellency Fan, have you heard of me?

13:41.170 --> 13:42.450
Yes.

13:42.660 --> 13:44.400
Your Excellency Shen, why not wear your robe?

13:45.900 --> 13:47.470
My robe doesn't fit.

13:47.490 --> 13:49.030
It's being altered in Shangjing.

13:49.050 --> 13:50.150
Your Excellency Fan, I beg you pardon.

13:50.170 --> 13:51.570
That's fine! That's fine!

13:52.020 --> 13:53.350
Where's Miss Si?

13:53.370 --> 13:55.400
This way, please.

13:59.820 --> 14:01.470
Your Excellency Shen, won't you check her out?

14:01.490 --> 14:04.120
It's fine. The mammies will handle it.

14:04.140 --> 14:05.460
By the imperial edict of His Majesty,

14:05.460 --> 14:07.590
Miss Si, we're here to escort you to Shangjing.

14:07.610 --> 14:09.270
Please come with us.

14:09.290 --> 14:10.560
I'm a new official.

14:10.580 --> 14:12.640
In a high position at such a young age,

14:12.660 --> 14:15.280
you do have a successful official career.

14:15.700 --> 14:16.830
I'm just lucky.

14:16.850 --> 14:18.240
Your Excellency Shen, I'm really flattered.

14:18.260 --> 14:19.730
You're the one

14:19.730 --> 14:20.820
who's really in a high position.

14:20.820 --> 14:22.080
Miss Si, you're injured?

14:23.530 --> 14:24.770
Hold her.

14:29.260 --> 14:30.910
Miss Si is injured!

14:30.930 --> 14:31.880
Mammy,

14:31.900 --> 14:32.970
on our way here,

14:32.970 --> 14:34.120
some bandits pretended to be

14:34.140 --> 14:35.220
the followers of Shangshan Hu,

14:35.220 --> 14:36.840
trying to take Xiao En away.

14:36.930 --> 14:38.560
Miss Si was shot accidentally.

14:38.580 --> 14:39.510
She's fine now.

14:39.530 --> 14:41.610
How can you let her be injured?

14:41.610 --> 14:44.080
Do you want to lose your head?

14:44.970 --> 14:46.600
Who is she?

14:47.370 --> 14:49.250
She's an old servant in the imperial palace.

14:49.820 --> 14:52.140
Your Excellency Shen, no need to be flattering.

14:52.140 --> 14:54.030
Unlike Nanqing,

14:54.050 --> 14:56.840
Beiqi is a great country.

14:58.460 --> 14:59.820
Such a great country was actually

14:59.820 --> 15:01.710
so defeated as to cede territory for mercy.

15:01.730 --> 15:03.080
What did you just say?

15:03.100 --> 15:04.410
I said Beiqi lost the war

15:04.410 --> 15:05.680
and was utterly humiliated.

15:05.700 --> 15:06.960
How dare you!

15:07.460 --> 15:08.170
Let go of me!

15:08.170 --> 15:09.320
Mammy!

15:09.340 --> 15:10.440
Let go!

15:10.460 --> 15:12.450
-Let go! -Fine.

15:13.820 --> 15:15.510
We Nanqing people are straight-forward.

15:15.530 --> 15:17.800
You asked me to let go, so I let go.

15:17.820 --> 15:19.240
Come on! Get up!

15:19.260 --> 15:20.370
Look at you!

15:23.730 --> 15:26.390
How could you watch him violate me

15:26.410 --> 15:29.720
on our territory?

15:30.020 --> 15:32.760
Humiliating the envoy equals humiliating Nanqing.

15:32.780 --> 15:34.100
If the war is restarted,

15:34.100 --> 15:35.320
whose responsibility might that be?

15:35.340 --> 15:37.100
You! You!

15:37.100 --> 15:37.780
Mammy! Mammy!

15:37.780 --> 15:38.370
Calm down!

15:38.370 --> 15:39.730
-Come on! -I'm so pissed!

15:39.730 --> 15:41.760
Come on! Calm down! Calm down!

15:41.780 --> 15:43.280
That bastard

15:43.410 --> 15:45.330
is too arrogant!

15:50.260 --> 15:51.570
Take care!

16:07.900 --> 16:09.210
Your Excellency Fan.

16:10.290 --> 16:12.570
Where is Xiao En?

16:24.730 --> 16:26.480
Your Excellency Xiao En!

16:28.020 --> 16:29.400
Who are you?

16:30.260 --> 16:31.390
I'm Shen Zhong,

16:31.410 --> 16:33.400
Commander-in-chief of Embroidered Uniform Guards.

16:34.460 --> 16:35.770
I don't know you.

16:38.410 --> 16:39.710
Sure! Sure! Sure!

16:39.730 --> 16:41.350
When Your Excellency Xiao
rode the whirlwind in Nanqing and Beiqi,

16:41.370 --> 16:43.120
I was nobody.

16:43.140 --> 16:44.820
Your name is widely known.

16:44.820 --> 16:46.320
I feel so excited

16:46.340 --> 16:48.840
to finally see you in person.

16:51.020 --> 16:52.200
Your Excellency Fan,

16:52.220 --> 16:53.020
we'll escort His Excellency Xiao

16:53.020 --> 16:54.880
from now on.

16:54.900 --> 16:56.330
Of course.

17:15.650 --> 17:16.630
Your Excellency Fan,

17:16.650 --> 17:17.630
you just said that some people tried to

17:17.650 --> 17:19.960
save His Excellency Xiao along the way.

17:19.980 --> 17:21.600
I stopped them.

17:26.930 --> 17:28.250
Your Excellency Xiao,

17:28.930 --> 17:30.560
that's not right.

17:30.890 --> 17:32.370
Look around!

17:32.620 --> 17:34.650
You're home now.

17:34.700 --> 17:36.510
Why do you want to run away?

17:36.530 --> 17:38.270
If you run away again halfway,

17:38.290 --> 17:40.560
I won't be able to fulfill my task.

17:40.980 --> 17:42.370
Right?

17:45.050 --> 17:46.930
What do you want?

17:48.170 --> 17:49.720
We should take our work

17:49.740 --> 17:51.650
seriously.

18:02.010 --> 18:03.410
Now it should be fine.

18:04.170 --> 18:06.130
Your Excellency Xiao, I'll take you to your carriage.

18:50.170 --> 18:51.720
Knowing that you're coming back,

18:51.740 --> 18:52.580
the Embroidered Uniform Guards

18:52.580 --> 18:53.770
have specially made

18:53.770 --> 18:55.410
an iron carriage for you.

18:55.770 --> 18:56.650
It's an honor

18:56.650 --> 18:58.600
no one else can enjoy.

19:07.890 --> 19:09.560
Sorry to let you see this.

19:11.250 --> 19:12.770
Your Excellency Shen,

19:13.580 --> 19:15.800
how can you be so cruel to your people

19:15.820 --> 19:18.530
but flattering to someone from Nanqing?

19:19.220 --> 19:21.960
Shame on you!

19:22.010 --> 19:23.960
Calm down! Calm down!

19:23.980 --> 19:25.360
Calm down!

19:25.380 --> 19:26.860
I'll report your behaviors to

19:26.860 --> 19:28.770
the Empress Dowager.

19:34.860 --> 19:36.230
Wait a moment, please.

19:36.250 --> 19:37.480
Please come with me.

19:37.500 --> 19:38.960
What do you want?

19:39.290 --> 19:40.960
I have my difficulty.

19:40.980 --> 19:42.870
You'll know it after I tell you.

19:42.890 --> 19:44.870
Come on! Come on! Come on!

19:44.890 --> 19:46.250
Come on! Come on!

19:46.410 --> 19:48.130
Your Excellency Fan, wait a minute.

19:57.980 --> 19:59.600
Why do you have to

19:59.740 --> 20:01.770
talk here?

20:04.250 --> 20:06.720
I know after serving the Empress Dowager for many years,

20:06.740 --> 20:08.030
you're bonded with Her Majesty.

20:08.050 --> 20:10.530
Do you want me to spare your life?

20:14.050 --> 20:14.770
It seems that

20:14.770 --> 20:16.370
you don't know me after all.

20:24.930 --> 20:26.200
Sorry to keep you waiting.

20:26.220 --> 20:28.170
Sorry to keep you waiting.

20:30.220 --> 20:31.770
It's weird.

20:32.100 --> 20:33.870
Anyhow,

20:33.890 --> 20:35.150
after talking with her,

20:35.170 --> 20:36.200
she felt so ashamed

20:36.220 --> 20:37.390
that she left on her own,

20:37.410 --> 20:40.250
saying that she would never go back to Shangjing.

20:43.250 --> 20:45.250
Do you have anything to say?

20:47.930 --> 20:49.680
Different people have different aspirations. Just let her go.

20:49.700 --> 20:51.390
Let's get ready and set off soon.

20:51.410 --> 20:52.250
His Majesty is anxious

20:52.250 --> 20:53.770
to meet His Excellency Fan.

20:57.890 --> 21:00.440
Meet me? Why?

21:00.930 --> 21:03.130
You'll know when you arrive in Shangjing.

21:03.860 --> 21:04.840
By the way, Your Excellency Fan,

21:04.860 --> 21:06.390
how's Head Chen doing recently?

21:06.410 --> 21:07.720
He's fine.

21:08.580 --> 21:09.130
Your Excellency Fan,

21:09.130 --> 21:10.680
a word please.

21:14.380 --> 21:15.460
Come on.

21:20.460 --> 21:22.080
Your Excellency Fan, did Head Chen give you

21:22.100 --> 21:24.080
any task this time?

21:25.380 --> 21:26.890
To take Yan Bingyun back.

21:27.100 --> 21:28.270
Nothing else?

21:28.290 --> 21:29.890
What else can there be?

21:32.050 --> 21:33.360
Let me make a bold guess.

21:33.380 --> 21:34.010
If I guess wrong,

21:34.010 --> 21:35.600
please don't laugh at me.

21:35.620 --> 21:36.600
Firstly,

21:36.620 --> 21:38.720
you should take Yan Bingyun back of course.

21:38.740 --> 21:41.110
Secondly, since His Excellency Xiao is back,

21:41.130 --> 21:44.110
Head Chen must be too worried to sleep.

21:44.130 --> 21:46.380
Perhaps he asked you to

21:46.380 --> 21:48.010
assassinate His Excellency Xiao.

21:48.130 --> 21:49.840
Find the chance to kill Xiao En

21:49.860 --> 21:52.770
after taking back Yan Bingyun.

21:53.010 --> 21:54.410
Anything else?

21:55.340 --> 21:57.050
His Majesty himself specially requested

21:57.050 --> 21:58.320
Si Lili be sent back.

21:58.340 --> 22:00.480
It's a good chance to set a trap.

22:01.170 --> 22:02.480
On our way back,

22:02.500 --> 22:03.620
I'll check whether Miss Si Lili

22:03.620 --> 22:05.050
is OK or not.

22:05.100 --> 22:07.320
I made the poison of

22:07.340 --> 22:09.200
Red Sleeve Edict myself.

22:10.100 --> 22:11.250
By the way,

22:12.010 --> 22:13.840
Yan Bingyun is caught,

22:13.860 --> 22:14.770
but he isn't the only secret agent

22:14.770 --> 22:16.340
from the Investigator's Office

22:16.340 --> 22:18.080
in Beiqi.

22:18.410 --> 22:19.870
Did Head Chen send you here

22:19.890 --> 22:22.840
to reorganize the intelligence network?

22:23.170 --> 22:24.720
Stay vigilant to one person.

22:25.130 --> 22:27.390
Shen Zhong, Commander-in-chief of Embroidered Uniform Guards.

22:27.410 --> 22:28.680
You must be careful with him.

22:28.700 --> 22:30.320
It mustn't be someone good

22:30.340 --> 22:32.290
who can be remembered by you.

22:33.740 --> 22:35.320
If so,

22:35.460 --> 22:37.370
what are you going to do?

22:38.290 --> 22:40.270
Nonsense! Nonsense!

22:40.290 --> 22:42.250
Your Excellency Fan, never mind.

22:42.380 --> 22:43.170
Whatever you want to do

22:43.170 --> 22:44.750
in Shangjing,

22:44.770 --> 22:47.320
I'll keep you company.

22:51.770 --> 22:52.840
Let's set off.

22:52.860 --> 22:54.560
Your mission can follow us.

23:05.010 --> 23:06.200
Your Excellency.

23:06.530 --> 23:08.390
All my tasks in Beiqi,

23:08.410 --> 23:10.530
he has guessed them right.

23:11.650 --> 23:14.170
Shen Zhong does live up to his name.

23:15.820 --> 23:17.890
Then what should we do?

23:19.290 --> 23:21.320
Just wait and see.

23:21.770 --> 23:23.270
Shangjing Town of Beiqi

23:23.290 --> 23:25.530
will be our battlefield.

24:04.770 --> 24:06.010
Xiao En suffers a lot

24:06.010 --> 24:07.720
from Shen Zhong along the way.

24:09.290 --> 24:10.600
Your Excellency,

24:10.860 --> 24:12.480
I just don't get it.

24:12.820 --> 24:13.860
Xiao En used to be

24:13.860 --> 24:14.990
an important official of Beiqi.

24:15.010 --> 24:16.800
Why does Shen Zhong torture him?

24:17.930 --> 24:19.410
Who knows?

24:23.820 --> 24:25.130
Who's there?

24:26.500 --> 24:28.720
Assassin! Catch that assassin!

24:28.740 --> 24:30.230
Everyone! Assassin!

24:30.250 --> 24:31.080
Assassin!

24:31.100 --> 24:32.130
There's an assassin raiding the camps.

24:32.130 --> 24:32.910
What should we do?

24:32.930 --> 24:34.360
The assassin is raiding Beiqi's camps.

24:34.380 --> 24:35.380
We're kind enough

24:35.380 --> 24:37.130
not to join the attack.

24:37.380 --> 24:38.720
That's right.

24:47.130 --> 24:48.440
Here!

24:54.580 --> 24:55.270
Circle the assassin around!

24:55.290 --> 24:56.650
Don't let the assassin run away.

24:59.770 --> 25:01.250
The assassin failed.

25:06.620 --> 25:08.370
Get the assassin! Come on!

25:18.740 --> 25:20.080
Stop!

25:48.620 --> 25:51.200
The assassin runs into Nanqing's camps.

25:52.700 --> 25:54.320
There's no one in the tent behind me.

25:54.340 --> 25:55.650
Thank you.

26:00.620 --> 26:01.890
A woman?

26:05.820 --> 26:06.560
Who's she?

26:06.580 --> 26:08.130
Who else can she be?

26:09.290 --> 26:10.720
Which one?

26:14.130 --> 26:17.290
That Saintess he fought at start but fell in love with later.

26:18.250 --> 26:20.320
Cut the crap! Don't seek death!

26:34.380 --> 26:36.250
Put your weapons down! Put them down!

26:36.460 --> 26:38.370
Make no mistake.

26:41.220 --> 26:43.320
Your Excellency Fan, sorry to bother you.

26:43.820 --> 26:46.650
An assassin raided our camps. Sorry to let you see this.

26:48.580 --> 26:52.230
I saw the assassin running this way.

26:52.250 --> 26:53.630
I wonder whether you saw the assassin or not.

26:53.650 --> 26:55.010
I saw her.

26:55.620 --> 26:57.410
She's in the tent behind me.

27:04.380 --> 27:05.600
Just go inside and search.

27:05.620 --> 27:07.460
Don't you want to imply

27:07.460 --> 27:09.370
our Nanqing mission is behind the assassination?

27:09.500 --> 27:10.600
Your Excellency Shen,

27:10.620 --> 27:12.410
what about capturing me as well?

27:12.740 --> 27:13.720
Your Excellency Fan,

27:13.740 --> 27:15.890
don't be angry.

27:16.380 --> 27:18.270
If the assassin takes order from you,

27:18.290 --> 27:19.960
she wouldn't have run to you.

27:19.980 --> 27:21.720
How can I not know that?

27:22.930 --> 27:24.480
She was running towards that direction.

27:30.290 --> 27:32.050
You still don't believe me, right?

27:32.530 --> 27:33.930
Come on! Come on! Come on!

27:34.580 --> 27:35.510
Your Excellency Shen,

27:35.530 --> 27:37.130
search the tent yourself.

27:49.740 --> 27:51.840
No need! No need! No need!

27:52.700 --> 27:54.130
Go back.

27:54.530 --> 27:55.930
Go back to your posts.

27:59.500 --> 28:00.720
Your Excellency Fan,

28:00.740 --> 28:02.480
I'm really sorry.

28:02.500 --> 28:03.410
Sorry to bother you.

28:03.410 --> 28:05.440
Please accept my apology.

28:10.500 --> 28:12.890
Your Excellency Fan, you also love to eat sweet potatoes.

28:23.580 --> 28:25.530
They are good stuff.

28:26.170 --> 28:27.890
Fragrant and sweet to eat.

28:28.740 --> 28:30.290
Your Excellency Shen, won't you chase after the assassin?

28:31.250 --> 28:32.510
I didn't catch the assassin just now.

28:32.530 --> 28:34.410
Now I won't be able to catch the assassin.

28:34.890 --> 28:36.560
Was the assassin injured by you?

28:38.700 --> 28:40.440
It's Xiao En's blood.

28:40.700 --> 28:41.680
I was talking with Senior Xiao

28:41.700 --> 28:43.960
just now.

28:43.980 --> 28:45.100
Your Excellency Shen,

28:45.100 --> 28:47.290
what on earth do you want to know?

28:48.050 --> 28:49.410
I don't know.

28:51.380 --> 28:52.800
You don't know?

28:53.290 --> 28:55.050
I really don't.

28:56.340 --> 28:57.270
I just know that

28:57.290 --> 28:59.230
Chen Pingping kept him alive for so long

28:59.250 --> 29:01.130
because of the secret he knows.

29:01.290 --> 29:03.340
The Empress Dowager and His Majesty

29:03.340 --> 29:05.110
want to know what it is.

29:05.130 --> 29:06.990
Since Senior Xiao doesn't want to tell me,

29:07.010 --> 29:08.800
I have to ask him often.

29:10.130 --> 29:10.770
He was an important official

29:10.770 --> 29:12.270
of Beiqi.

29:12.290 --> 29:13.840
Circumstances change with the passage of time.

29:13.860 --> 29:15.680
Plus he's the adoptive father of Shangshan Hu,

29:15.700 --> 29:17.770
he needs to be warned.

29:21.340 --> 29:24.200
Isn't Shangshan Hu the Beiqi War God?

29:27.410 --> 29:29.600
He's good at fighting battles indeed.

29:29.620 --> 29:31.930
But that may not be a good thing.

29:32.340 --> 29:34.410
Your Excellency Fan, to be honest,

29:34.620 --> 29:37.750
Shangshan Hu is transferred back to Shangjing.

29:37.770 --> 29:39.600
Nominally, he is the Grand General,

29:39.620 --> 29:42.680
but actually he's only got
one hundred private soldiers by his side.

29:45.860 --> 29:47.480
A promotion nominally but a demotion in fact,

29:47.500 --> 29:48.480
he has lost the military power.

29:48.500 --> 29:49.840
Indeed.

29:52.580 --> 29:54.370
But he is to blame

29:54.820 --> 29:56.370
for not understanding the situation.

29:56.620 --> 29:59.650
In such a complicated situation,
he neither pledges allegiance to His Majesty

29:59.650 --> 30:01.680
nor visits the Empress Dowager.

30:02.100 --> 30:04.150
As officials,

30:04.170 --> 30:05.910
if you're not loyal,

30:05.930 --> 30:08.600
what can you get? Right?

30:10.250 --> 30:12.200
Then whose side are you on?

30:13.170 --> 30:15.320
I'm loyal to the Empress Dowager.

30:17.250 --> 30:18.340
Your Excellency Shen,

30:18.340 --> 30:20.050
you're really outspoken.

30:20.380 --> 30:21.720
I admire scholars

30:21.770 --> 30:23.840
all the time.

30:24.250 --> 30:26.650
Your Excellency Fan, talented as you are in poetry,

30:26.860 --> 30:29.130
have you written any masterpiece recently?

30:30.130 --> 30:31.910
Well, have you figured out

30:31.930 --> 30:33.650
the secret?

30:40.700 --> 30:43.050
He refuses to talk. No hurry.

30:43.820 --> 30:45.680
There's still a long time ahead.

30:45.700 --> 30:46.770
You've made

30:46.770 --> 30:48.130
Xiao En suffer.

30:48.500 --> 30:49.560
If he stages a comeback

30:49.580 --> 30:51.200
in future,

30:52.650 --> 30:54.250
he surely will get back at you.

30:58.220 --> 31:00.320
Chen Pingping is worried, right?

31:03.860 --> 31:05.890
When you're back, tell Head Chen that

31:05.980 --> 31:09.110
Xiao En has no chance.

31:09.130 --> 31:10.440
Just think about it.

31:10.580 --> 31:11.250
Even now, there's an assassin

31:11.250 --> 31:12.770
trying to kill him.

31:14.100 --> 31:15.750
Many people want him dead in Beiqi.

31:15.770 --> 31:17.600
The number is no less than that of Nanqing.

31:21.170 --> 31:23.480
Well then, I will interrupt you no more.

31:24.820 --> 31:26.770
We're about to reach Shangjing.

31:27.010 --> 31:28.440
Just like I said,

31:28.460 --> 31:30.600
man should understand the situation.

31:30.860 --> 31:31.720
Your Excellency Fan,

31:31.740 --> 31:33.150
don't make it hard for me.

31:33.170 --> 31:35.930
Take your time and enjoy the food.

31:49.930 --> 31:51.800
Take them away.

32:07.100 --> 32:08.840
He serves the Empress Dowager.

32:08.860 --> 32:10.530
So do you.

32:11.380 --> 32:12.150
How come you two

32:12.170 --> 32:13.720
are fighting each other?

32:16.620 --> 32:18.360
My teacher wants to kill Xiao En.

32:18.380 --> 32:20.650
As an apprentice, I have to obey her order.

32:24.930 --> 32:27.770
So I kind of saved your life.

32:28.170 --> 32:29.870
You lifted the curtain just now.

32:29.890 --> 32:32.150
I'm bluffing. Don't you understand?

32:32.170 --> 32:33.770
What if your plan doesn't work

32:33.770 --> 32:35.030
and he actually catches me?

32:35.050 --> 32:36.050
Then so be it.

32:36.050 --> 32:37.680
How is that relevant to me?

32:38.650 --> 32:40.440
Is it a joke for you?

32:41.290 --> 32:42.890
Will you assassinate Xiao En again?

32:44.860 --> 32:45.800
I have no chance.

32:45.820 --> 32:48.230
After entering Shangjing, I have no way to kill him.

32:48.250 --> 32:49.290
Then when we reach Shangjing,

32:49.290 --> 32:50.650
let's cooperate with each other.

32:50.930 --> 32:51.840
How?

32:51.860 --> 32:53.110
Anyway you like.

32:53.130 --> 32:54.320
Whoever you find annoying,

32:54.340 --> 32:55.630
I'll help you deal with him.

32:55.650 --> 32:57.100
By collaborating with me from within,

32:57.100 --> 32:58.770
we can bring trouble to the country.

32:58.890 --> 33:00.110
What's in it for you?

33:00.130 --> 33:01.650
I'm from Nanqing.

33:01.740 --> 33:02.860
The more chaotic Beiqi is,

33:02.860 --> 33:04.410
the happier I will be.

33:05.050 --> 33:06.250
I'm leaving.

33:06.380 --> 33:07.930
Just think about it.

33:17.700 --> 33:18.930
She's gone?

33:20.770 --> 33:22.170
Really?

33:25.740 --> 33:27.170
She's gone.

33:28.860 --> 33:31.250
It seems that Beiqi is really chaotic.

33:31.410 --> 33:33.110
This might be our chance.

33:33.130 --> 33:34.440
Right,

33:34.460 --> 33:37.270
we can seize the chance to take the Saintess back.

33:37.290 --> 33:38.870
What're you thinking?

33:38.890 --> 33:40.960
It's our chance to fulfill the mission task.

33:40.980 --> 33:42.600
Right! Right! Right!

33:42.620 --> 33:45.930
It's a good excuse to fool the public.

33:47.380 --> 33:48.600
Right!

33:48.770 --> 33:49.800
Lend me some money.

33:49.820 --> 33:51.890
Give me silver instead of bank notes.

33:57.220 --> 33:59.530
I'll pay you twice as much when we go back to the capital city.

34:00.010 --> 34:01.370
Twice?

34:03.290 --> 34:05.480
You two, turn around.

34:22.620 --> 34:23.510
What's up?

34:23.530 --> 34:24.710
At dawn tomorrow,

34:24.730 --> 34:26.120
you should leave on your own.

34:26.140 --> 34:27.760
Don't let others see you.

34:28.050 --> 34:28.730
Go south to Shangjing Town,

34:28.730 --> 34:30.600
and find a Tiaowang Inn.

34:30.620 --> 34:32.160
Take the money, get yourself a room,

34:32.180 --> 34:33.600
and stay there.

34:35.140 --> 34:36.670
Why should I listen to you?

34:36.690 --> 34:38.840
Only by helping me complete the task of the Investigator's Office

34:39.100 --> 34:41.130
can you get your father out of the jail.

35:33.770 --> 35:35.510
Your Excellency, as you commanded,

35:35.530 --> 35:36.840
our agents watch the place closely

35:36.860 --> 35:38.120
and see a man from the Nanqing mission

35:38.140 --> 35:39.640
slip away secretly.

35:39.660 --> 35:41.470
Now he stays in an inn south of Shangjing.

35:41.490 --> 35:42.640
Should we catch him?

35:42.660 --> 35:44.040
Leave him alone.

35:44.380 --> 35:45.800
Let him stay there

35:45.820 --> 35:46.880
as if we don't know.

35:46.900 --> 35:48.640
Let's see what His Excellency Fan

35:48.660 --> 35:50.690
will do next.

35:51.660 --> 35:52.890
Yes.

35:59.180 --> 36:02.490
Your Excellency, we've arrived in Shangjing Town.

36:02.940 --> 36:04.230
After taking Yan Bingyun back,

36:04.250 --> 36:05.840
we can go home.

36:05.860 --> 36:07.670
I'm afraid it's not that simple.

36:07.690 --> 36:09.650
Your Excellency, you feel something might go wrong.

36:15.210 --> 36:16.370
Look.

36:17.140 --> 36:18.450
Here comes trouble.

36:25.010 --> 36:26.840
Grand General!

36:27.450 --> 36:28.770
Whatever it is,

36:28.770 --> 36:30.080
just send me a message.

36:30.100 --> 36:31.970
How come you're here in person?

36:32.010 --> 36:33.730
I want to see him?

36:34.010 --> 36:35.670
See whom?

36:35.690 --> 36:37.170
My adoptive father.

36:37.250 --> 36:39.490
Who's your adoptive father?

36:40.100 --> 36:41.730
Xiao En.

36:43.420 --> 36:44.820
So Senior Xiao

36:44.820 --> 36:46.800
is actually your adoptive father.

36:46.820 --> 36:48.450
It's true that man from a military family

36:48.450 --> 36:49.880
is bound to be extraordinary.

36:49.900 --> 36:51.030
Where is he?

36:51.050 --> 36:52.650
He's here! He's here!

37:08.620 --> 37:10.840
Why is he so tortured?

37:16.620 --> 37:18.360
I interrogated him according to the imperial edict.

37:18.380 --> 37:20.130
You did this to him?

37:20.420 --> 37:21.760
Yes.

37:25.620 --> 37:26.920
Grand General, since he's your father,

37:26.940 --> 37:29.490
you can have a closer look at him.

37:29.730 --> 37:31.030
It's a pity that

37:31.050 --> 37:33.320
I broke his legs,

37:33.340 --> 37:34.580
or you might see him

37:34.580 --> 37:36.730
stand up.

37:42.660 --> 37:45.620
Grand General, are you satisfied with what you see?

37:45.620 --> 37:46.670
Give him to me.

37:46.690 --> 37:48.080
I'm afraid I can't.

37:48.100 --> 37:49.930
How dare you defy my order?

37:50.970 --> 37:52.930
Grand General, you don't know.

37:53.210 --> 37:55.670
His Majesty and the Empress Dowager of Beiqi

37:55.690 --> 37:56.860
ordered me to lock Xiao En up

37:56.860 --> 37:58.160
in the Division of Embroidered Uniform Guards.

37:58.180 --> 38:00.040
I can't defy the imperial order.

38:02.530 --> 38:05.170
Grand General, what else can I do for you?

38:15.140 --> 38:16.730
Shen Zhong,

38:20.730 --> 38:22.560
good for you.

38:30.730 --> 38:33.410
Grand General, thank you for the compliment.

38:33.770 --> 38:36.600
I'm just loyal to my country.

38:41.340 --> 38:42.510
Your Excellency,

38:42.530 --> 38:45.650
Shen Zhong is not good at dealing with other officials.

38:46.580 --> 38:47.840
Right.

38:48.490 --> 38:51.080
He's vicious and cruel,

38:51.100 --> 38:52.470
but he's too arrogant

38:52.490 --> 38:53.920
to restrain himself.

38:53.940 --> 38:55.890
It will definitely get him into trouble.

38:56.010 --> 38:57.030
Exactly.

38:57.050 --> 38:58.400
Shangshan Hu almost

38:58.420 --> 39:00.410
attacked him just now.

39:00.530 --> 39:02.000
He did it on purpose.

39:03.010 --> 39:04.160
On purpose?

39:04.180 --> 39:06.600
From breaking Xiao En's legs on the border

39:06.620 --> 39:08.970
to torturing Xiao En cruelly along the way,

39:09.010 --> 39:10.800
he did all that to provoke Shangshan Hu.

39:10.820 --> 39:12.650
Make Shangshan Hu attack him?

39:13.210 --> 39:15.580
After all, Shangshan Hu has brilliant achievements in war.

39:15.580 --> 39:16.920
To punish him,

39:16.940 --> 39:18.800
there should be a reason.

39:19.140 --> 39:22.240
By making him attack the mission,

39:22.420 --> 39:25.080
Shangshan Hu can be accused of defying the imperial edict.

39:25.100 --> 39:26.050
I'm afraid he will also

39:26.050 --> 39:27.600
be accused of treason.

39:28.450 --> 39:30.640
Who gave the order,

39:30.660 --> 39:32.320
the Empress Dowager of Beiqi or the little emperor?

39:33.140 --> 39:34.650
Maybe both.

39:35.620 --> 39:36.970
I didn't expect Shangshan Hu

39:37.900 --> 39:40.600
to be so feared in Beiqi.

39:40.620 --> 39:42.130
It's a good thing.

39:42.530 --> 39:43.970
Really?

39:45.490 --> 39:46.800
Your Excellency Fan,

39:47.140 --> 39:48.470
His Majesty is anxious to see you.

39:48.490 --> 39:49.470
I'm sorry that

39:49.490 --> 39:50.600
you'll have to first meet His Majesty in the imperial palace

39:50.620 --> 39:52.240
and then go to your residence.

39:52.420 --> 39:53.890
We can go inside now.

40:13.100 --> 40:15.190
Won't Miss Si Lili go to the imperial palace?

40:15.210 --> 40:16.100
She has no status.

40:16.100 --> 40:18.450
She should live outside the imperial palace
and wait for the chance.

40:18.820 --> 40:21.210
Are you familiar with Miss Lili?

40:21.730 --> 40:23.080
I caught her.

40:24.730 --> 40:27.240
Won't Xiao En's carriage go inside the town?

40:27.620 --> 40:29.240
He will go inside from the West Gate.

40:29.290 --> 40:30.990
You also see what happened just now.

40:31.010 --> 40:32.250
We don't know what will happen

40:32.250 --> 40:33.930
when we go inside.

40:38.050 --> 40:40.560
When two counties are at war, no messengers shall be killed.

40:40.730 --> 40:42.890
Nanqing has won a landslide victory this time.

40:43.140 --> 40:44.730
When entering the town,

40:44.730 --> 40:46.800
we certainly won't see people
welcoming us on both sides of the street,

40:48.050 --> 40:50.760
but they can't go so far as to throw rotten eggs at us.

40:53.050 --> 40:54.690
Get out of Beiqi!

40:54.690 --> 40:56.840
No envoy from Nanqing is welcome!

40:56.860 --> 40:59.010
You! Get off!

40:59.010 --> 41:00.970
Nanqing dogs!

41:02.210 --> 41:04.100
You're not welcome! You're not welcome!

41:04.100 --> 41:06.380
Get out of Beiqi! Get off!

41:06.380 --> 41:07.950
Throw at him!

41:07.970 --> 41:11.130
Get off! Get off!

41:11.820 --> 41:14.650
Get off! Get off!

41:15.250 --> 41:16.860
You're not welcome in Beiqi!

41:16.860 --> 41:17.800
There're vegetables and eggs

41:17.820 --> 41:19.140
enough for several meals.

41:19.140 --> 41:20.430
Let's add dishes tonight.

41:20.450 --> 41:21.840
Yes, Your Excellency.

41:21.860 --> 41:23.360
Get off!

41:23.380 --> 41:25.320
Get off, Nanqing dogs!

41:25.340 --> 41:26.380
You're not welcome!

41:26.380 --> 41:27.750
Get out of Beiqi.

41:27.770 --> 41:29.560
Our people are concerned about national affairs.

41:29.580 --> 41:30.770
Since we lost the battle,

41:30.770 --> 41:32.270
they can't help feeling angry.

41:32.290 --> 41:34.130
I'm afraid they're not all common people.

41:34.210 --> 41:36.600
You killed Cheng Jushu,

41:36.730 --> 41:38.600
the martial arts master of Beiqi, on the street.

41:38.620 --> 41:40.670
Men in the army and on the streets who practice martial arts

41:40.690 --> 41:42.970
want to learn from you.

41:43.100 --> 41:45.030
They are not bound by rules.

41:45.050 --> 41:47.930
They might assassinate you or make a sneak attack.

41:48.210 --> 41:50.520
You'd better hide in the carriage.

41:50.690 --> 41:52.600
It won't take long.

41:53.100 --> 41:54.530
The Embroidered Uniform Guards

41:54.530 --> 41:55.670
can't even keep their own capital under control?

41:55.690 --> 41:57.950
I'm really not competent enough.

41:57.970 --> 41:59.690
Sorry! Sorry!

41:59.900 --> 42:01.710
As the envoy of Nanqing,

42:01.730 --> 42:03.750
if I hide in the carriage

42:03.770 --> 42:04.920
on my way to the imperial palace,

42:04.940 --> 42:05.950
I'm afraid I'll dishonor

42:05.970 --> 42:07.600
my country completely.

42:08.420 --> 42:09.430
If you don't hide,

42:09.450 --> 42:11.030
with more rotten vegetables and worn-out shoes coming,

42:11.050 --> 42:13.230
it's not so honorable, either.

42:13.250 --> 42:14.580
So I'll dishonor

42:14.580 --> 42:16.080
my country either way.

42:16.100 --> 42:19.410
I just can't quell the public anger.

42:19.730 --> 42:21.560
You're really good.

42:21.580 --> 42:23.130
You misunderstood me.

42:24.580 --> 42:26.000
Wait!

42:26.690 --> 42:28.080
Gao.

42:31.380 --> 42:32.730
There's a long roll of cloth on the carriage

42:32.730 --> 42:33.920
behind which carries cargos.

42:33.940 --> 42:34.920
Bring it to me.

42:34.940 --> 42:36.410
Yes, Your Excellency.

43:04.360 --> 43:07.940
In the river of history,

43:07.960 --> 43:11.430
time goes round and round.

43:14.240 --> 43:17.580
Memories about the former and present lives

43:17.600 --> 43:21.670
join each other in an endless way.

43:23.560 --> 43:26.180
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:26.200 --> 43:28.440
one season follows another in a flash,

43:28.440 --> 43:30.940
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:30.960 --> 43:32.560
I just can't give up

43:32.560 --> 43:35.900
to be with you for my whole life.

43:35.920 --> 43:41.390
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:42.640 --> 43:45.190
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:45.480 --> 43:47.520
Year after year in the wandering,

43:47.520 --> 43:50.180
I count the remaining years.

43:50.200 --> 43:52.380
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:52.400 --> 43:54.390
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:54.680 --> 43:57.070
I never feel regretful.

43:57.120 --> 43:58.480
In such a chaotic world,

43:58.480 --> 44:01.460
I still miss you as ever.

44:01.480 --> 44:04.430
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:04.720 --> 44:06.780
With a gentle heart,

44:06.800 --> 44:09.460
I cherish our remaining years.

44:09.480 --> 44:11.000
Even though we have to go through

44:11.000 --> 44:13.510
all the hardships along the journey,

44:13.640 --> 44:20.830
you always stay by my side,

44:20.920 --> 44:23.590
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:23.880 --> 44:25.960
Year after year in the wandering,

44:25.960 --> 44:28.620
I count the remaining years.

44:28.640 --> 44:30.780
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:30.800 --> 44:33.030
even though we end up the destiny,

44:33.240 --> 44:35.420
I never feel regretful.

44:35.440 --> 44:36.840
In such a chaotic world,

44:36.840 --> 44:39.900
I still miss you as ever.

44:39.920 --> 44:43.030
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:43.120 --> 44:45.260
With a gentle heart,

44:45.280 --> 44:47.980
I cherish our remaining years.

44:48.000 --> 44:49.440
Even though we have to go through

44:49.440 --> 44:52.100
all the hardships along the journey,

44:52.120 --> 45:00.880
you always stay by my side...
